#, no-wrap
msgid "Frontend three-tier export convention"
msgstr "前端三层导出约定"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:8
msgid ""
"Embeddable frontend content packs register via **manifest / desktop / "
"mobile** exports."
msgstr "可嵌入的前端内容包通过 **manifest / desktop / mobile** 导出项注册。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:10
msgid ""
"The unified settings window is aggregated by the registry in [`packages/"
"shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/); contract in [`packages/shell-ui/src/"
"settings.ts`](../../packages/shell-ui/src/settings.ts) (unrelated to SAP)."
msgstr ""
"统一设置窗口由 [`packages/shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/) 中的 "
"registry 聚合；契约见 [`packages/shell-ui/src/settings.ts`](../../packages/"
"shell-ui/src/settings.ts)（与 SAP 无关）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manifest (required)"
msgstr "Manifest（必填）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:14
msgid "Path: `./manifest` — JSON-serializable metadata."
msgstr "路径：`./manifest` — 可 JSON 序列化的元数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:24
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Field             | Description                                    |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `appId`           | Application id                                 |\n"
#| "| `displayName`     | Display name                                   |\n"
#| "| `version`         | Version (usually synced with monorepo root package) |\n"
#| "| `supportsDesktop` | Supports desktop embed                         |\n"
#| "| `supportsMobile`  | Supports mobile embed                          |\n"
#| "| `connectionKind`  | See table below                                |\n"
#| "| `sap`             | Optional; SAP satellites only                  |\n"
msgid ""
"| Field             | Description                                         |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | Application id                                      |\n"
"| `displayName`     | Display name                                        |\n"
"| `version`         | Version (usually synced with monorepo root package) |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | Supports desktop embed                              |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | Supports mobile embed                               |\n"
"| `connectionKind`  | See table below                                     |\n"
"| `sap`             | Optional; SAP satellites only                       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段              | 说明                                           |\n"
"| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | 应用 id                                        |\n"
"| `displayName`     | 显示名称                                       |\n"
"| `version`         | 版本（通常与 monorepo 根 package 同步）        |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | 支持桌面嵌入                                   |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | 支持移动嵌入                                   |\n"
"| `connectionKind`  | 见下表                                         |\n"
"| `sap`             | 可选；仅 SAP 卫星                              |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "connectionKind"
msgstr "connectionKind"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:32
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Value              | Represents                    | Sidecar required?                          |\n"
#| "| ------------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| `embedded-sidecar` | companion (VRM + tools)       | **Yes** (embedded in same process)         |\n"
#| "| `sap-direct`       | chat (renderer → Hub SAP)     | **No** (persist `instance_id` only)        |\n"
#| "| `hub-rest`         | Admin console (Hub REST)      | **No**                                     |\n"
msgid ""
"| Value              | Represents                | Sidecar required?                   |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | companion (VRM + tools)   | **Yes** (embedded in same process)  |\n"
"| `sap-direct`       | chat (renderer → Hub SAP) | **No** (persist `instance_id` only) |\n"
"| `hub-rest`         | Admin console (Hub REST)  | **No**                              |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 值                 | 表示                          | 是否需要 Sidecar？                         |\n"
"| ------------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | 伴侣（VRM + 工具）            | **是**（嵌入同一进程）                     |\n"
"| `sap-direct`       | 聊天室（渲染器 → Hub SAP）    | **否**（仅持久化 `instance_id`）           |\n"
"| `hub-rest`         | 管理台（Hub REST）            | **否**                                     |\n"

