#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop / Mobile (optional)"
msgstr "Desktop / Mobile（可选）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:39
msgid ""
"`./desktop` — desktop shell compile-time import profile (window spec, launch "
"mode)"
msgstr "`./desktop` — 桌面 shell 编译期导入配置（窗口规格、启动模式）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:39
msgid ""
"`./mobile` — mobile profile; when unsupported, `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"
msgstr "`./mobile` — 移动配置；不支持时 `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:41
msgid ""
"`embedMode: \"bundled-spa\"` — UI bundled in client install; Hub provides `/"
"api` and `/sap/v1` only."
msgstr ""
"`embedMode: \"bundled-spa\"` — UI 随客户端安装打包；Hub 仅提供 `/api` 与 `/"
"sap/v1`。"

